# Exports of BeOS R5's libroot.so that programs built with this toolchain can
# link against. Input for: makeimport --from-list libroot.exports libroot.so libroot.a
#
# One export per line: "<name> code" (a function) or "<name> data" (a variable).
#
# The names below are the C functions and variables declared in the public
# BeOS R5 headers (posix/*, be/kernel/*), restricted to those that libroot.so
# actually exports (a name in a header that the library does not export would
# fail at load time). No code or header text is copied: this is a list of names.
# It is not the full export list of libroot.so (about 930 symbols); add a line
# here to link against more.

# Used by libretro (beosstart.c, beossyscalls.c) but not declared in the public
# headers: BeOS's own startup code calls the first two; get_image_symbol is
# declared with a calling-convention macro the header scan above did not match.
_call_init_routines_ code
_thread_do_exit_notification code
get_image_symbol code

